00:05:52,941 --> 00:05:58,941
Meet Private Artie Crawford. He’s 92¾ and he’s just gone AWOL.

2
00:11:45,882 --> 00:11:51,882
The Last Rifleman is a drama, history, war film directed by Terry Loane.

3
00:17:38,823 --> 00:17:44,823
A WWII veteran escapes his care home in Northern Ireland and embarks on an arduous but inspirational journey to France to
attend the 75th anniversary of the D-Day landings, finding the courage to face the ghosts of his past.

4
00:23:31,764 --> 00:23:37,764
Artie Crawford, played by Pierce Brosnan.

5
